      "message": "This code does not consider the implementation of isWfcProvisionedOnDevice:\n\n654    public boolean isWfcProvisionedOnDevice() {\n655        if (getBooleanCarrierConfig(\n656                CarrierConfigManager.KEY_CARRIER_VOLTE_OVERRIDE_WFC_PROVISIONING_BOOL)) {\n657            if (!isVolteProvisionedOnDevice()) {\n658                return false;\n659            }\n660        }\n661\n662        if (getBooleanCarrierConfig(\n663                CarrierConfigManager.KEY_CARRIER_VOLTE_PROVISIONING_REQUIRED_BOOL)) {\n664            return isWfcProvisioned();\n665        }\n666\n667        return true;\n668    }\n\nisWfcProvisionedOnDevice might call isVolteProvisionedOnDevice if KEY_CARRIER_VOLTE_OVERRIDE_WFC_PROVISIONING_BOOL is TRUE. \n\nThis means that the result of isWfcProvisionedOnDevice might change even if we get a new onConfigChanged for VLT_SETTING_ENABLED, not just when we get a onConfigChanged for VOICE_OVER_WIFI_SETTING_ENABLED as the current patchset assumes.",
